    ],
    "text": "IT is hereby notified that the Annual Esala Festival and Procession at the Historic Seenigama Sri Devol Maha Devalaya Situated in the Grama Niladhari Division of Seenigama, Divisional Secretary's Division of Madampagama of the District of Galle, Southern Province, will be held during the period from Thursday, 21st of August 2025 to Thursday, 28th of August 2025 as per the orders made under the Extraordinary Gazette Notification No. 1965/39 dated 06.05.2016 of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka in terms of Section 2 of the Pilgrimages Ordinance (Chapter 175).",
